!/docs/how-to/develop-this-module.md
!/docs/how-to/adopt-this-template.md
!/docs/how-to/generate-terraform-graphs.md
!/docs/how-to/review-release-evidence.md

!/docs/explanation/
!/docs/explanation/architecture.md
!/docs/explanation/threat-model.md
!/docs/explanation/testing-strategy.md
!/docs/explanation/dependency-graph-validation.md

