# ----- [ GitHub configuration ] -------------------------------------------------------------------

!/.github/
!/.github/CODEOWNERS
!/.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md
!/.github/renovate.json5
!/.github/workflows/
!/.github/workflows/codeql.yaml
!/.github/workflows/pr-validation.yaml
